<title>FRANCE: Reuters 3rd ex-Paris Asia/Mideast air cargo report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 3rd ex-Paris Asia/Mideast air cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are current average ex-Paris French franc air cargo rates per kilo for a 100kg shipment with volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>				 May 29		    April  18</p>
<p>	 ASIA/PACIFIC</p>
<p>	 PAR-SEL	     11.40		     11.40</p>
<p>	 PAR-NAR	     15.50		     15.30</p>
<p>	 PAR-TPE		8.20			8.00</p>
<p>	 PAR-HKG		9.10			8.90</p>
<p>	 PAR-SIN		8.50			8.50</p>
<p>	 MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>	 PAR-DXB		5.60			5.60</p>
<p>The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller cargo agents based at the Paris airports.</p>
<p>All prices are quoted in French francs.</p>
<p>The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+5017</p>
